        "evidence_id": "E004",
        "passage_id": "P003",
        "quote": "Here, the defendants, moving separately, each established their prima facie entitlement to judgment as a matter of law by demonstrating that as individual unit owners of the condominium, they had no duty to maintain the vestibule where the accident occurred, as it was one [*2] of the condominium's common elements",
        "statement_status": "court_finding"
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "E005",
        "passage_id": "P003",
        "quote": "In opposition, the plaintiff failed to raise a triable issue of fact as to, inter alia, whether the defendants created the alleged wet condition that caused the plaintiff to slip and fall",
        "statement_status": "court_finding"
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "E006",
        "passage_id": "P003",
        "quote": "Contrary to the plaintiff's contention, those branches of the defendants' separate motions which were for summary judgment dismissing the complaint insofar as asserted against each of them were not premature.",
        "statement_status": "court_finding"
      },
